00:03:13.856 --> 00:03:16.874
&gt;&gt; YEAH, THE ANSWER IS YES.

00:03:16.876 --> 00:03:18.926
THERE’S A REASON FOR THAT.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.888
AT THIS PARTICULAR TIME WE’RE

00:03:20.889 --> 00:03:23.033
NOT CERTAIN WHETHER OR NOT

00:03:23.067 --> 00:03:24.871
VACCINATION IS GOING TO PROTECT

00:03:24.872 --> 00:03:26.405
YOU AGAINST GETTING INFECTED BUT

00:03:26.439 --> 00:03:28.158
