00:03:40.408 --> 00:03:42.523
95% EFFICACY WAS EFFECTIVE IN

00:03:42.524 --> 00:03:43.710
PREVENTING SYMPTOMATIC DISEASE.

00:03:43.712 --> 00:03:46.652
