00:03:52.119 --> 00:03:54.380
SO IT’S CONCEIVEABLE THAT I COUL

00:03:54.415 --> 00:03:55.674
GET VACCINATED, GET INFECTED AND

00:03:55.675 --> 00:03:57.685
HAVE NO SYMPTOMS BECAUSE THE

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:59.204
VACCINE IS PREVENTING ME FROM

00:03:59.238 --> 00:04:01.496
GETTING SYMPTOMS.

00:04:01.497 --> 00:04:10.713
BUT I STILL COULD HAVE VIRUS IN

00:04:10.714 --> 00:04:14.359
