00:04:22.901 --> 00:04:23.813
INFECTED INADVERTENTLY BECAUSE

00:04:23.847 --> 00:04:25.693
YOU’VE BEEN VACCINATED BUT YET

00:04:25.694 --> 00:04:27.101
YOU MIGHT PASS THE INFECTION TO

00:04:27.102 --> 00:04:29.252
