00:04:40.744 --> 00:04:44.186
&gt;&gt; NO, I WASN’T RECOMMENDING IT.

00:04:44.221 --> 00:04:46.138
THERE’S A LOT OF DISCUSSION

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.081
