00:04:59.076 --> 00:05:01.148
SO PEOPLE HAVE ASKED, IF I WEAR

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.059
TWO MASKS, WOULD THAT BE BETTER?

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:05.994
THE ANSWER IS WE DON’T HAVE THE

