00:05:07.315 --> 00:05:08.530
RECOMMENDATION OF THAT.

00:05:08.531 --> 00:05:09.918
BUT IT MAKES COMMON SENSE THAT

00:05:09.953 --> 00:05:12.575
IF IT MAKES YOU FEEL MORE

00:05:12.576 --> 00:05:14.637
COMFORTABLE AND MORE PROTECTED,

00:05:14.671 --> 00:05:16.370
THERE’S NOTHING WRONG WITH

00:05:16.404 --> 00:05:17.729
WEARING TWO MASKS.

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:19.774
SO RATHER THAN HAVE A FORMAL

00:05:19.775 --> 00:05:22.703
RECOMMENDATION BECAUSE WE DON’T

00:05:22.737 --> 00:05:26.198
