00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.444
YOU’D LIKE TO WEAR ONE, DO

00:05:28.478 --> 00:05:29.305
AHEAD.

00:05:29.306 --> 00:05:32.448
I HAVE MYSELF IN THE PAST WORE

00:05:32.483 --> 00:05:33.629
TWO MASKS.

00:05:33.630 --> 00:05:36.481
&gt;&gt; Neil: HOMELAND SECURITY IS

00:05:36.482 --> 00:05:38.322
FORCING THEISH YOU AT TSA,

